  "releaseNotes": "v0.35.1.3\n    - Processing an invoice based on an order number.\n    - Added endpoints for creating and updating ItemNumbers.\n    - Added endpoints for locking and unlocking a SalesOrder via WMS status (v2 endpoint).\n    - Added an endpoint for fully returning a PurchaseOrder.\n    - Added an endpoint for creating a new RMAOrder line.\n    - Added an endpoint for creating a new RTVOrder line.",
